  <wpt lat="49.176405966281891" lon="-116.0132300388068">
    <ele>0</ele>
    <time>2026-06-27T16:48:31Z</time>
    <name>Narrow/no Shoulder</name>
    <cmt>"Crowsnest east of Yahk, shoulders are substandard compared to the rest. Still mostly fine, a bit cracked but very bikeable, except for one spot at around 49.176406, -116.013230. Narrow shoulder alongside a railway track and river, and in the one spot the shoulder completely disintegrates. I was going fairly slow, and still nearly wiped out."&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;https://www.facebook.com/groups/1551091118449121/posts/3790728024485408</cmt>
