  <wpt lat="49.208906963467598" lon="-122.89805699139833">
    <ele>0</ele>
    <time>2026-06-27T16:48:31Z</time>
    <name>the bridge is scheduled to be replaced by 2024</name>
    <cmt>The new four-lane toll-free bridge will provide important improvements for everyone using the bridge, including people who are driving, cycling or walking, as well as communities on either side of the bridge, including:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;    A safer crossing for all bridge users with modern, wider lanes, separated by a centre median barrier&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;    Dedicated walking and cycling lanes, separated from traffic by a barrier on both sides of the bridge&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;    Better connections to, from and near the bridge&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The new bridge is scheduled to open in 2024. The existing bridge will remain in use until the new bridge is open to traffic. Once the new bridge is open, the existing bridge will be removed.</cmt>
    <desc>The new four-lane toll-free bridge will provide important improvements for everyone using the bridge, including people who are driving, cycling or walking, as well as communities on either side of the bridge, including:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;    A safer crossing for all bridge users with modern, wider lanes, separated by a centre median barrier&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;    Dedicated walking and cycling lanes, separated from traffic by a barrier on both sides of the bridge&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;    Better connections to, from and near the bridge&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The new bridge is scheduled to open in 2024. The existing bridge will remain in use until the new bridge is open to traffic. Once the new bridge is open, the existing bridge will be removed.</desc>
    <sym>Flag, Blue</sym>
    <type>user</type>
    <extensions>
