    <name>Use Flashers when entering tunnel</name>
    <cmt>"&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;* When cycling on Highway 1 east of Hope, activate your flashers before entering tunnels. These tunnels have narrow shoulders and some are on a curve so it is difficult for motorists to see cyclists. We're piloting an active warning sign to warn motorist to be are that a cyclist may be in the tunnel, and to proceed with extra caution."&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/transportation/driving-and-cycling/cycling/cycling-regulations-restrictions-rules</cmt>
